{
  "slug": "sap-gen-code",
  "name": "Sap Gen Code",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "ABAP code generation pipeline: convert design docs, extract structured data, validate process/DDIC, generate ABAP (incl. CDS views) and ABAP Unit tests, and run an AI semantic + security review. Companion to sap-dev-core (install that first — its shared scripts are required at runtime).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `sap-docs-check` (Validates an extracted design spec before ABAP code generation, across two dimensions: `ddic` checks DDIC objects (domains /…), `sap-docs-convert` (Applies customer-specific normalisation rules to the extracted spec files in a work folder), `sap-docs-estimate` (Turn the spec pipeline's structural signals into a transparent, falsifiable effort estimate — no gut feel), `sap-docs-extract` (Reads a SAP design document (Excel .xlsx, Word .docx, PDF) — or an existing work folder / a…), `sap-docs-layout` (Edits the structural layout of a SAP design spec template (.xlsx) by writing to the workbook's `(Meta) Layout`…), `sap-gen-abap` (Generates ABAP source code from a process text file ({doc_name}_process.txt) produced by sap-docs-extract), `sap-gen-abap-unit` (Generates ABAP Unit tests for an EXISTING object (global class / function module / report) and closes the…), `sap-gen-cds` (Generates an ABAP CDS view (Core Data Services) from a spec or a natural-language description and deploys it…), and 4 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sap-gen-code@claude-community` from `sapdev-ai/sap-dev` (`plugins/sap-gen-code`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
